OL,3,GNEWSA'I didn't think a man could get a
OL,4,Abreast cancer lump'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Paul Jennings noticed a small lump
OL,7,Fin his chest while recovering from a
OL,8,Fcold, breast cancer was the last thing
OL,9,Fon his mind.
OL,11,FThe father-of-three, from Loxley in
OL,12,Fsouth Warwickshire, had previously been
OL,13,Frunning and assumed the irritation
OL,14,Faround his nipple was nothing more than
OL,15,Fa rash.
OL,17,FInstead, tests revealed a pre-cancerous
OL,18,Flump that led to him having a
OL,19,Fmastectomy.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
