OL,3,GNEWSA'I didn't think a man could get a
OL,4,Abreast cancer lump'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost two years on, Jennings is
OL,7,Fsharing his story to encourage more men
OL,8,Fto check themselves and raise awareness
OL,9,Fabout male breast cancer. "It's
OL,10,Fsomething we all need to be aware of,"
OL,11,Fhe said.
